  {
   "id": "sec1-1",
   "section": "History",
   "text": "Prominent poet, Kumaran Asan served as the founding editor of Vivekodayam, which published its first monthly issue in April, 1904 and it soon became the leading literary journal in Kerala.",
   "words": 30,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1",
